      "message": "A few questions:\n- Should the ide info link against the implementation jar? Could that lead to exposing the implementation details to the IDE users?\n- Should the dep jar of ide info contain the documentation? If so, I believe that it should always link against the from-source stub jar, as the from-text stub jar does not include the documentation.",
